msgid "The minimum steps to get the camera working include"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:44
#: 6fdc2456bc5e4e478353337d1bd275cf
msgid "`Setup adb <https://docs.modalai.com/setup-adb/>`__ on an Ubuntu workstation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:45
#: 30e7a328ec6d4aff910a13f561f2fede
msgid "Connect the camera to the Ubuntu workstation, start and adb shell and `run voxl-configure-vision-px4 <https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-vision-px4-installation/>`__ (Note: you may simply press <enter> when asked for an IP address)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:46
#: e047e7b06a6749f99db396f4ca099471
msgid "run \"systemctl enable voxl-mavlink-server\" to configure the mavlink server to start automatically"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:47
#: 492d563635204640b4eb94d460976ca1
msgid "Optionally `run \"systemctl status voxl-vision-px4\" <https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-cam-user-guide-core/#view-visual-inertial-odometry-data>`__ to check if VOXL is producing good position estimates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:50
#: 2b21bba922a447c3a8254b6045d3b22b
msgid "Autopilot Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:52
#: 91b289babd5944fdad8a2cc7272372d7
msgid "Connect to the autopilot with a ground station (i.e. Mission Planner) and check that the following parameters are set:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:54
#: 872307d27a2e453092b3d3a4df860504
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 2 (MAVLink2).  Note this assumes the camera is connected to the autopilot's \"Telem2\" port."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:55
#: 766251a8fa824879b5c09bdca53a19cb
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921 (921600 baud)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:56
#: ba5c351872544d2db33694d1c0a65fa0
msgid "Optionally set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS <SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` = 1024 (Don't forward mavlink to/from) to disable the camera's odometry messages from being sent to the GCS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:57
#: 3e71d80f343e4ff2861f13138a17509d
msgid "Optionally set :ref:`MAV3_EXTRA3 <MAV3_EXTRA3>` = 0 to disable sending the SYSTEM_TIME message to the camera which has been known to cause the camera to lose its position estimate (e.g. quality falls to -1).  Note this assumes the camera is connected to the autopilot's second mavlink port (e.g. usually Telem2)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:58
#: a7587de6a58c4313a3713e2172938fd2
msgid ":ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` = 3 (VOXL)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:59
#: 70f52a63bd5b49ee8f7783707af6e5f6
msgid "Set :ref:`VISO_POS_X <VISO_POS_X>`, :ref:`VISO_POS_Y <VISO_POS_Y>`, :ref:`VISO_POS_Z <VISO_POS_Z>` to the camera's position on the drone relative to the center-of-gravity.  See :ref:`sensor position offset compensation <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` for more details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:60
#: f8c1b60ac751452fb3dbfa9b6bafcd5a
msgid "Optionally increase :ref:`VISO_QUAL_MIN <VISO_QUAL_MIN>` to 10 (or higher) to only consume estimates from the camera when the quality is 10% (or higher)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:62
#: 412b6ade4abb4357aaf54b9c9e1e5d89
msgid "If only the VOXL camera will be used for position estimation and heading (e.g. No GPS):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:64
#: 916f0d43ae5647fd8a83610d82d06a82
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 6 (ExternalNav)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:65
#: ca34ff0226a340f3b8f9ff95b44af986
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 6 (ExternalNav)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:66
#: 7c08388d1c66400a99b8318d4c90a66f
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 6 (ExternalNav)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:67
#: 66b663f105a64bbca505266135d2b4e7
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` = 6 (ExternalNav)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:68
#: 3aaed04e944a4bae86ec186b18318052
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 6 (ExternalNav)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:70
#: fe5b5cffde5345159644f2984c53beef
msgid "After the parameters are modified, reboot the autopilot.  Connect with the ground station and (if using Mission Planner) right-mouse-button-click on the map, select \"Set Home Here\", \"Set EKF Origin Here\" to tell ArduPilot where the vehicle is and it should instantly appear on the map."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:72
#: e073f95c39c24a85a7e08623e3e6b068
msgid "For indoor/outdoor transitions (e.g. VOXL camera indoors, GPS+Compass outdoors):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl.rst:74
#: 562c05511f3e4fc8a0d640ea0abd43e7
msgid ":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 3 (GPS)"
